{"id":"evft9cb5o4f16zrz8b6j8hi40","title":"日本探测器因发动机故障更改目标","originalTitle":"Japan space probe changes target over engine trouble","summary":"日本探测器Hayabusa-2因发动机老化问题更改了其延伸任务的目标，原计划飞往1998 KY26小行星，现改为飞往2015 BM510小行星，预计2028年飞掠。新目标是直径17至74米的小行星，旋转周期为49分钟。此次调整有助于未来的小行星防御任务。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Phys.org"},"links":{"original":"https://phys.org/news/2026-11-japan-space-probe.html"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-17T10:38:13.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-17T12:44:33.532Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-17T12:44:33.532Z","category":"quantum-physics","tags":["研究成果"],"score":49,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"138c3474-38a3-477d-8e95-bb623f1f0095","title":"日本探测器因发动机故障调整小行星探测目标"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"138c3474-38a3-477d-8e95-bb623f1f0095","title":"日本探测器因发动机故障调整小行星探测目标"}],"topics":[],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fAoX7V5GITwQ","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}